{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9b9e1a538bd192d1af47654cfedd6e14897d8065c5c1f50d37ed57e2a86e3a20", "ja": "（劇場で、朋花の個人インタビューがある。\n今日の取材は、いつもと少し違うところがある……）", "zh": "（剧场里要进行朋花的个人采访。\n今天的采访和往常有些不一样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1001_p", "source_sha256": "621fd47ede3f6018c37adc003211af78fd498edcd4a7908e257fa6f8a63db030", "ja": "朋花、お疲れ様。\nそろそろ取材の時間だけど、準備はいいか？", "zh": "朋花，辛苦了。\n采访的时间快到了，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "dc8c8ee8b3da73d1657bec382b369f44983afe515aba78c8ca237084a88c5fd7", "ja": "ええ、もちろんです～。でも、不思議な気分ですね。\n私服で取材を受けるなんて……。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以啦～不过，感觉真是有些奇妙呢。\n居然要穿着私服接受采访……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4abd3f1fa43cc3b707dd60364f5f9ac6d11e09bd1a711bdbb981576924a9d0a2", "ja": "そうだよな。先方が事前にとったアンケートで、\n『私服姿が見たい』って意見が多かったそうなんだ。", "zh": "是啊，确实。不过，听起来真是不可思议呢。\n居然要穿着私服接受采访……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "623247ccf5a46a348935b3d132a6727d42b3423dd001994b8f3d3c279e5afdee", "ja": "衣装だけでなく、私服も見たいだなんて、\n子豚ちゃん達は本当に欲張りさんですね～。", "zh": "不只想看演出服，还想看便服，小猪猪们真是贪心呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "3f2cef9d897242a0d3db9b9e971aaa1aedc573411d2d7908c42b4d53d69737a8", "ja": "ですが、これも聖母の務め。\n日頃の奉仕に感謝して、期待に応えてあげましょう～。", "zh": "不过，这也是圣母的职责。\n感谢小猪们平日里的侍奉，就满足你们的期待吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2a2e01cf3538652153155c65c25c75fa2fb837c61c5328bad3b971728bb40858", "ja": "そうしてくれると助かるよ。\n今日の服、朋花によく似合ってるな。", "zh": "你愿意这么做的话，可就帮大忙了。\n你今天这身衣服很适合朋花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "9a5af552f4f165200588e6c581479a52af3f86ff26a6977f90df76c9b8e974a8", "ja": "ありがとうございます。恵美さんや翼ちゃんにいくつか\n選んでもらって、最後は自分で選んだんです～。", "zh": "谢谢您。惠美和翼帮我挑选了几套，\n最后是由我自己选出来的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "bb8c65d86bd1810bd6278ea0dcd58e2a9f65ac4e5fd6b903070fb9d81eacab48", "ja": "たくさん試着をして、時間はかかりましたが……\n満足のいくコーディネートになったと思います～。", "zh": "试穿了很多套，虽然花了不少时间……\n但我觉得最后搭配出了令人满意的造型～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1009_p", "source_sha256": "06103a3765c084386cff6069ef46506742983a6e07a83ebd3f19e76a5dc302b5", "ja": "そうだったのか。きちんと用意してくれたなんて、\nさすがは朋花だな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。居然还特意为我认真准备了，真不愧是朋花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "9a38a69e91de5212de01c7f792b3879659af60c7a5d91b36ea99f3e4f83e5af2", "ja": "いえ、当然のことをしたまでです～。聖母として、\nふさわしい服を選ばないといけませんからね。", "zh": "不，我只是做了理所当然的事～作为圣母，当然得选一身相称的服装才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "90ba5712e8f989c890106c1a5a6d0a882f55eadd3f3d3cfcea434ba11c7ac503", "ja": "季節を意識しつつ、聖母の気品と輝きを\nさらに増してくれるような服装にしてみました～。", "zh": "既顾及到了季节感，又选了能让圣母的\n高雅与光芒更添几分光彩的装束哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "997142fda228b6602a42e521176a16b4e37a57959d6d6f0a66204d553367086e", "ja": "髪型も変えてみたのですが、\nいかがですか、{$P$}さん～？", "zh": "我还试着换了个发型，您觉得怎么样，{$P$}先生～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1013_p", "source_sha256": "20d08ddf657472c649560a52f4dd3f81ae43bbb1995b67692582fa0540d01bca", "ja": "ああ。大人っぽくて品もあって、\n朋花にピッタリなコーディネートだと思うよ。", "zh": "啊。既成熟又有品位，我觉得这套搭配非常适合朋花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "afda9259f0a574128e3737d74dbb3f299dc86aa603c1fc1c086ce016b8dfd7fd", "ja": "……なんだか物足りないですね～。\nどうして感想を尋ねたか、理由を考えてください。", "zh": "……总觉得不够满意呢～。\n请好好想想，我为什么要问您的感想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "07abb8d2aa965ee57879ca612d3d148c9f6e0b8ccfe5c5ecda6e6d4d59e5ee84", "ja": "聖母の私服を、誰よりも先に見せているんです……。\n生半可なほめ言葉では、満足できません～。", "zh": "我可是第一个让你看到圣母便服的人……\n不够诚恳的赞美，可无法让我满足～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e52fba7fe1fc7e01c950227cf977dc3fdd8d446c29899e96e4a8992d4738db58", "ja": "そ、そうか……。すまなかったな、朋花。\nもう一度チャンスをくれないか？", "zh": "是、是这样啊……抱歉了，朋花。\n能不能再给我一次机会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "ffe0bb5577a2baba1e08784f66cc6fb68d09d96072339366b23bb9bb310ed7cf", "ja": "ふぅ……仕方ありませんね～。\nもう一度だけですよ～？", "zh": "呼……真没办法呢～  \n这次就再给你一次机会哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "134f97ea56add3f837a98e175b82c841be539f28359d35d53ac5e0dbe3823ef3", "ja": "では、{$P$}さん？\n言葉を尽くして、聖母をほめたたえてくださいね～。", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生？\n请用尽赞美之词，好好夸奖圣母吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0d5e17465fa47eed0fdb47ecd7716ab5d3e43ce86a8301883a1dd5fcb031d31a", "ja": "ええと……日本一、いや、世界一可愛いぞ、朋花！\n聖母の眩しい姿に、子豚ちゃん達も大歓喜に違いない！", "zh": "那个……日本第一，不，世界第一可爱，朋花！\n看到圣母这耀眼的模样，小猪们肯定也会欣喜若狂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f4abcdd235bcb4d6ceb23150e3489f2d1266cca1e1a2f615a6daefbaa354df40", "ja": "その服を着た朋花と出かけられたら、最高に幸せだー！\n……ハア、ハア。これじゃダメかな？", "zh": "要是能和穿着那身衣服的朋花一起出门，我就幸福到极点了——！\n……哈啊，哈啊。这样不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "5aa2dc342c101036b12d230b8e74d46c387fed49fb18140e6262dc9b6094b80e", "ja": "うふふ♪　聖母への信仰心は伝わってきましたから、\nギリギリ合格としましょう～。", "zh": "呵呵♪　我已经感受到你对圣母的虔诚信仰了，\n就勉强算你及格吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "503576544938591c3947b528bf5f2171c8cbf60d611e85f6c38541cbb8f09a14", "ja": "身のほど知らずな発言も聞こえた気がしますが……\n今回は不問としてあげますね～♪", "zh": "我好像还听到了不自量力的话……不过这次就不追究了哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0354_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3ef572760508e2e1716825e744b1fbba8f149c6ecd00def797a1df21de6002f6", "ja": "（……た、助かった。しかし、服を褒めてほしかった\nなんて。まだまだ乙女心の勉強が足りないみたいだ）", "zh": "（……太、太好了，得救了。不过，居然想让人夸衣服什么的……看来我还得好好学习一下少女心啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
